                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Slymes is a fun arena-type party game that can be played single or multiplayer with different game modes such as free for all, team death-match, and party with four maps to choose from. The point is to get points by eating (running over) little pebbles that are indicated by the yellow triangle floating above them, once you get these you'll start to grow in size and are able to eat other players or bots until you win the game.\n\nIf you are interested in Steam inventory items this game has x1-3 drops a day depending on how often you can get on the game. [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=873140323]Steam Inventory Guide[/url]",
